      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of pointlessness is a heavy weight, and it's understandable why the silence feels so loud when you're carrying that burden. If the idea of \"making a difference\" feels too big, perhaps the first step is just finding a small moment of relief for yourself. Please consider reaching out to a crisis lifeline; they are trained to sit with that exact feeling of weight and meaninglessness without judgment. You can call or text 988 anytime to talk to someone right now.",
