      "content": "It sounds like you are craving a profound release from the pressure of carrying the world's weight, and the peace of indifference can feel very appealing when things are hard. Please realize that while the world *can* keep turning, your life is infinitely more valuable than one small piece of the landscape. Even if things feel indifferent right now, there are people who deeply care about your well-being and want to help you find a different kind of peace. Please reach out to 988; they can support you through this overwhelming feeling.",
